  "sourceTitle": "Optimizations Claude did for Qwen 3.8 27B and Qwen Flash Next on dual and quad 7900xtx",
  "sourceBodyHash": "f9fba636692a6f368d2b1826f1b9e5cb3790e502b6f8cffb278a08596ff924c8",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-07T13:56:41.511126Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-07T13:57:59.956584Z",
  "totalBlocks": 28,
  "translatedBlocks": 28,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e55134f8fd3ed2b9",
      "translationZh": "这些都是在 ROCm 和 llama server 中的修复。如果有人感兴趣请告诉我。我会将其推送到 GitHub 并分享我的配置。我有一台运行着 4 张 7900XTX 的 Lenovo P620，插在 Gen 4.0 x16 插槽上。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da44c1a449805ec0",
      "translationZh": "每项修复的一行摘要：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e2d147936185b441",
      "translationZh": "异步镜像输入上传：在每个 GPU 流的固定环形缓冲区（pinned ring）中暂存约 30 个逐 token 输入，而非采用同步往返传输（Flash-Next 解码从 24.6 提升至 36.3 t/s）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3771a6c617f7bc02",
      "translationZh": "单设备分发线程：每个 GPU 的内核（kernels）和集合通信（collectives）由其各自的主机线程启动，而不是由一个线程管理全部四个 GPU。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4fce9933d5e930e5",
      "translationZh": "单次 PCIe P2P AllReduce：针对小张量，GPU 直接将切片写入对等设备的内存中，取代了 RCCL（每次 AllReduce 从约 57 us 降至约 9 us）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2b3b8cb599dd08e5",
      "translationZh": "减少 MTP 解码中的内核数量：融合了相同形状的复制操作并实现了更精简的 conv-state 回滚（从 88.8 提升至 92.7 t/s）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "50fbb2b28933e16c",
      "translationZh": "mmvq 小 K 值行打包（RDNA3）：短 K 值投影不再导致大部分数据块处于闲置状态（从 22.7 提升至 25.3 t/s）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8788fb80195e54ea",
      "translationZh": "用于多 token 批次的宽 K 值 mmvq：在 10240x320 投影的 MTP 验证中，K 值被分配到 8 个 warp 上（从约 92.6 提升至约 96 t/s）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "230f17b1ba345e64",
      "translationZh": "支持多达 8 个 token 的 MoE 向量内核：5 token MTP 验证批次保持在快速向量路径而非 MMQ（80.9 -> 86.7 t/s）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7aa4cf5c09deb8c9",
      "translationZh": "Small-K 多 token MoE 内核：针对短专家下投影切片，每个 warp 处理多行（94.2 -> 95.2 t/s）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb9759f58beac992",
      "translationZh": "宽 mmvf 块：针对微型长-K F32 矩阵使用 512/1024 线程块（40.6 -> 41.2 t/s）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "75ec6c3a7d170d14",
      "translationZh": "Q8_1 激活寄存器：每个激活值仅量化一次，并由所有读取它的矩阵乘法共享（约 +2 t/s）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1fd03ae1887138e6",
      "translationZh": "融合超连接链：scale/sigmoid/scale/hc_post 和 scale/silu 各自包含在一个内核中，每个 token 减少约 380 个内核（38.5 -> 40.6 t/s）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1b1ad96dcb85ab92",
      "translationZh": "Thin-F32 Prefill 内核：从通用 SGEMM 派生出 <=16 行的 F32 矩阵乘法（401 -> 21 us；pp4096 1602 -> 1836 t/s）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "686272139f48dafd",
      "translationZh": "紧凑型 MoE tile 列表：专家矩阵乘法仅启动有工作的（专家，token-tile）对，而非 96% 空置的网格（从 928 -> 405 us，gate/up 从 516 -> 360 us）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51d8b4159049b9b9",
      "translationZh": "多 warp MoE 路由辅助器：每个专家使用 16 个 warp 通过两次传递对 token 进行排序（每次调用从 99 -> 25 us）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c01ed05c71953eaa",
      "translationZh": "Q4_K 专家分块形状：针对 160 行专家切片的 32 行分块（360 -> 337 us）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "10476a828b758650",
      "translationZh": "针对少量分块 Q8_0 矩阵乘法的 Stream-k：将 10240->320 的投影分布到所有 CU 上，而非仅 12 个工作组（284 -> 115 us）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9fc999db0f68854d",
      "translationZh": "超连接内核中不再使用 64 位除法/取模：采用 3D 网格而非针对每个元素进行模拟整数除法（230 -> 79 us；使用 stream-k 时 pp2048 从 1593 提升至 1868 t/s）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7fd4c7db1243c850",
      "translationZh": "Split-K 路由 GEMM：将 512x512 F32 路由 GEMM 作为 8 个 K 块加一个求和处理（158 -> 69 us）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5c7c967ba9b79272",
      "translationZh": "MTP 重新预留修复：当 MTP 输出开启时重新预留图，从而结束每个预填充块都进行完整的 GPU 重新分配+同步的操作（88.5K 预填充从 1042 提升至 1130 t/s）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "84080e51eadfd956",
      "translationZh": "MTP 草案提示词窗口：草案头仅预填充最后 2048 个提示词 token（预填充从 1130 提升至 1249 t/s，解码速度从深度 46.6 提升至 64.9 t/s）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a40c833615f74284",
      "translationZh": "草案 ubatch 容量限制：草案计算缓冲区从 457 降至 247 MiB，修复了在 96K 上下文时 GPU0 显存溢出崩溃的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6b7835d63726cd72",
      "translationZh": "聚合稀疏注意力 (QSA)：解码时仅关注约 2K 个选定的 token，而不是对整个缓存进行掩码处理（48K 解码从 67.9 提升至 80.6 t/s）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c737bf0bf2e0bd1",
      "translationZh": "RAM 中的逐层嵌入表（--lazy-mode off）：26.8 GB 的哈希嵌入表保持驻留，而不是在每次迭代时从磁盘读取（查找时间从 1.0-1.6 ms 降至 0.1-0.3 ms，解码耗时降低约 3-4%）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8d61c931b3289865",
      "translationZh": "Meta 后端子图修复：针对最大图调整了每个设备的子图大小，修复了在调用之间图形状发生变化时导致的段错误（segfault）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4748f394df286a68",
      "translationZh": "最终结果，在 4 个 GPU 上运行 Qwen3.8-27B Q8：代码解码速度从 54-61 t/s 提升至 96-110 t/s，51K 上下文预填充（prefill）从 1454 t/s 提升至 1816 t/s，在 51K 深度下的解码速度从 57 t/s 提升至 77 t/s。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebb47853ee275840",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/NoFee9147 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
